{"3609610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Meat Market", "steam_appid": 3609610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended. You found a small village that didn't. They gave you the only thing they had to give: a knife, a counter, and a reason to keep moving. You feed the dead so the village can sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, your daughter was taken. You saw a shadow at the tree line and nothing more. It is time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece by piece, sale by sale, you'll get closer to the one who took her. It takes some meticulous work, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>This game contains extreme gore, dismemberment, and dark themes.</strong> ⚠️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HUNT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the safety of your shop and venture into the woods to find your next victim. Get out before they find what's missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/bdaa1dee1fd642ef4ee5ee7c51012743.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/bdaa1dee1fd642ef4ee5ee7c51012743.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/bdaa1dee1fd642ef4ee5ee7c51012743.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the body back, break it down with precision, and turn every part into something your customers will pay for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/7b769c327aa52b650f581ed8795b808b.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/7b769c327aa52b650f581ed8795b808b.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/7b769c327aa52b650f581ed8795b808b.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disassemble at the block. Knife for cuts, saw for bone. Mince, cook, package.  Learn flow of the trade, improve your efficiency, and master the rhythm of a village butcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/596b1c9c3210e23580b2c946fc4186c9.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/596b1c9c3210e23580b2c946fc4186c9.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/596b1c9c3210e23580b2c946fc4186c9.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE TRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers are zombies, and they do not come for vegetables. A stocked counter, the right products, and smart shop management can make all the difference. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/520d6aa0b62074920431f3bc7f8d880f.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/520d6aa0b62074920431f3bc7f8d880f.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/520d6aa0b62074920431f3bc7f8d880f.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with undead regulars for precious items that help you survive and progress. The better you serve them, the more valuable your connections become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/fd281c799241c36a9910aaf923f56895.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/fd281c799241c36a9910aaf923f56895.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/fd281c799241c36a9910aaf923f56895.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TRAIL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out who took her. Track the people connected to it. The village is small. People talk. Clues spread.  And eventually, the one you’re looking for will end up on your table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomorrow is going to ask more.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world ended. You found a small village that didn't. They gave you the only thing they had to give: a knife, a counter, and a reason to keep moving. You feed the dead so the village can sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, your daughter was taken. You saw a shadow at the tree line and nothing more. It is time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece by piece, sale by sale, you'll get closer to the one who took her. It takes some meticulous work, though.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚠️ <strong>This game contains extreme gore, dismemberment, and dark themes.</strong> ⚠️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE HUNT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the safety of your shop and venture into the woods to find your next victim. Get out before they find what's missing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/bdaa1dee1fd642ef4ee5ee7c51012743.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/bdaa1dee1fd642ef4ee5ee7c51012743.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/bdaa1dee1fd642ef4ee5ee7c51012743.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the body back, break it down with precision, and turn every part into something your customers will pay for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/7b769c327aa52b650f581ed8795b808b.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/7b769c327aa52b650f581ed8795b808b.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/7b769c327aa52b650f581ed8795b808b.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disassemble at the block. Knife for cuts, saw for bone. Mince, cook, package.  Learn flow of the trade, improve your efficiency, and master the rhythm of a village butcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/596b1c9c3210e23580b2c946fc4186c9.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/596b1c9c3210e23580b2c946fc4186c9.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/596b1c9c3210e23580b2c946fc4186c9.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE TRADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your customers are zombies, and they do not come for vegetables. A stocked counter, the right products, and smart shop management can make all the difference. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/520d6aa0b62074920431f3bc7f8d880f.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/520d6aa0b62074920431f3bc7f8d880f.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/520d6aa0b62074920431f3bc7f8d880f.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade with undead regulars for precious items that help you survive and progress. The better you serve them, the more valuable your connections become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/fd281c799241c36a9910aaf923f56895.poster.avif?t=1784810437\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/fd281c799241c36a9910aaf923f56895.webm?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/extras/fd281c799241c36a9910aaf923f56895.mp4?t=1784810437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE TRAIL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out who took her. Track the people connected to it. The village is small. People talk. Clues spread.  And eventually, the one you’re looking for will end up on your table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomorrow is going to ask more.</p>", "short_description": "Outside the last human city, you keep a butcher shop. Your customers shamble in at dusk. Stock comes from the city beyond. Village is home - they tolerate you because you keep the dead calm. And somewhere in that city is the one who took your daughter.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Turkish, French, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Italian, Dutch, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/71e42cf9efd2295c5d17625a439bcf198234e73b/header.jpg?t=1784810437", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/c621eda2234c3c4d551c11d010d9428b9024a9dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784810437", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609610/c621eda2234c3c4d551c11d010d9428b9024a9dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784810437", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum